<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <title>Parque Safari</title>
    <meta name="description" content="">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lato:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #f5f0e8; color: #2d1b00; font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; }
        .navbar-safari { background-color: #2d1b00; }
        .navbar-safari .navbar-brand { color: #e8a020 !important; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; transition: color 0.2s ease; }
        .navbar-safari .navbar-brand:hover { color: #c4850a !important; }
        .navbar-safari .nav-link { color: #f5f0e8 !important; transition: color 0.2s ease; }
        .navbar-safari .nav-link:hover { color: #e8a020 !important; }
        .btn-ingresar {
            background-color: #e8a020;
            color: #2d1b00;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.45rem 1.4rem;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-ingresar:hover {
            background-color: #c4850a;
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .hero-img { width: 100%; display: block; }
        .welcome-card {
            background-color: #fffdf7;
            border: 1px solid #ddd0b8;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(45,27,0,0.08);
            transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }
        .welcome-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(45,27,0,0.14); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    {% load static %}
    <div class="fs-5 fw-bold">
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg p-3 navbar-safari">
            <div class="container-fluid">
                <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">🦁 Parque Safari</a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler border-0" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarText" aria-controls="navbarText" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarText">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0">
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="#"></a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="mostrar_login/" class="btn btn-ingresar">
                        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-1"></i> Ingresar
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="container-fluid px-0">
        <img src="{% static 'imagenes/ps.avif' %}" alt="Parque Safari" class="hero-img">
    </div>

    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="welcome-card p-4 p-md-5 text-center">
                    <div class="mb-3" style="font-size: 3rem;">🦁</div>
                    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2" style="color: #2d1b00;">Bienvenido a Parque Safari</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary mb-4" style="color: #6b4c1e !important;">Sistema integral de punto de venta para la gestión de ventas, mesas, pedidos y más. Accede con tu usuario para comenzar.</p>
                    <a href="mostrar_login/" class="btn btn-ingresar btn-lg px-5">
                        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-2"></i>Ingresar al Sistema
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-FKyoEForCGlyvwx9Hj09JcYn3nv7wiPVlz7YYwJrWVcXK/BmnVDxM+D2scQbITxI" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>
</html>
